1vl9|n|The act of making smooth; a stroke which smooths. ; That which is smooth; the smooth part of anything.	a:25ia,64,4;1cf9,29,4;1rct,26,3~1cf9,29,4;25ia,64,4;1rct,26,3	v:1rvm,57,1;28fg,14,1~28fg,14,1;1rvm,57,1	n:5tw,21,1;1lmq,1,2~1lmq,1,2;5tw,21,1	N:1zqp,13,1~1zqp,13,1
